# No environment variables needed!
# Both contact and resume forms use Netlify Forms (built-in, free, zero config).
# 
# To receive email notifications for form submissions:
# 1. Go to Netlify Dashboard → Your Site → Forms
# 2. You will see "contact" and "resume-submission" forms after first deploy
# 3. Go to Settings → Forms → Form notifications → Add email notification
# 4. Set notification email to: sura767848@gmail.com
# 5. Repeat for both forms
